{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1064001001:0":{"text":"음...","source_cn":"唔……<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x16ADADC6BAFAD984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064001002:1":{"text":"라이오스, 드디어 깨어났구나!","source_cn":"莱欧斯！你终于醒了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x629D551451BE71D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064001003:1":{"text":"마르실, 칠책, 센... 윽, 센시는?","source_cn":"玛露西尔、齐尔查克、森……呃？森西呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC5B9402B29287F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064001004:1":{"text":"텔레포트될 때 기절해서, 옆에서 쉬고 있어.","source_cn":"森西晕传送，正在一旁休息。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCEC233DF66F36C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064001005:1":{"text":"미궁에서 텔레포트된 것 같아.","source_cn":"我们似乎在迷宫里被传送出来了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x270D75194005D00D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064001006:1":{"text":"그럼 여기는...?","source_cn":"所以，这里是……？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x979634A0BCCB8BF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064001007:1":{"text":"안녕하세요. 전 해미라고 해요. 여기는 에스페리아죠!","source_cn":"你好，我是漫漫。这里是伊索米亚。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF94679DB350208ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064001008:1":{"text":"잠깐, 이건... 말 하는 햄스터 마물이야?","source_cn":"等等——会说话的仓鼠魔物？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAA7E78EFD812A862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064001009:1":{"text":"...이건 서머너야!","source_cn":"……他们是使魔啦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBE56B90F85A33204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064001010:1":{"text":"치피와 해미는 강력한 마법사가 만들어낸 서머너야.","source_cn":"满满和漫漫是强大的魔法师——也就是我们那里被称为魔术师...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064001011:1":{"text":"마르실 씨 말이 맞아요! 저희 마스터는 에스페리아에서 가장 강력한 마법사인 멀린 님이시니까요!","source_cn":"玛露西尔小姐说得没错！我们的主人正是伊索米亚最强大的魔...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064001012:1":{"text":"전혀 들어본 적 없어...","source_cn":"完全没听说过……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC87A5BDEF55E37DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064001013:1":{"text":"으... 윽...","source_cn":"老……呕……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9E1B6F42FF0573C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064001014:1":{"text":"센시라는 분의 상태가 별로 좋지 않은 것 같네요. 먼저 미스테리 하우스로 돌아가서 치료해야겠어요.","source_cn":"这位森西先生看起来状态不是很好，先跟我们回神秘屋治疗一下吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7461B5B521238BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064001015:1":{"text":"치료할 방법이 있어? 그럼 부탁할게.","source_cn":"有办法治疗吗？那就拜托你们了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x25E57CBBDC3AF367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064001016:0":{"text":"잠깐, 아직 아무도 상황 설명을 제대로 안 해줬잖아. 가지 마!","source_cn":"等等，还是没有人跟我解释清楚状况啊！别走啊——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3D8528EFF16B50B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1064001017:1":{"text":"치피와 해미는 마르실 일행을 데리고 미스테리 하우스로 돌아왔다...","source_cn":"漫漫和满满带着玛露西尔一行人返回了神秘屋……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCC56AC51449DC902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064001018:1":{"text":"마스터, 마스터! 도와주세요!","source_cn":"梅林，梅林——快来帮帮忙！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x81254A07E3F8CCD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064001019:1":{"text":"여기 센시라는 분, 텔레포트 멀미가 엄청 심해요!","source_cn":"这位森西先生晕传送晕得很厉害！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x88CFD2626653834F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064001020:1":{"text":"센시는 드워프라서 텔레포트 멀미가 심하거든...","source_cn":"森西是矮人，是很容易晕传送的体质……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x19D3E1BC3580AF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064001021:1":{"text":"아, 소개하는 걸 잊었네. 멀린, 난 마르실이라고 해. 나도 마법사야.","source_cn":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male>...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1064001021":{"text":"아, 소개하는 걸 잊었네. 멀린, 난 마르실이라고 해. 나도 마법사야.","source_cn":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，我是玛露西尔，也是一名魔法师。","status":"matched_luae_markup","hash_xxh64":"0xE994AB8C6FA2B556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064001022:1":{"text":"나도 도울게!","source_cn":"我也来一起帮忙吧！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xC22896E2E85DCB9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064001023:1":{"text":"안... 돼... 윽...","source_cn":"不……要……呃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x152D35E755171AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1064001023":{"text":"안... 돼... 윽...","source_cn":"不……要……呃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x152D35E755171AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:1064001024:1":{"text":"우리의 치료를 받은 센시는 점차 안정을 되찾았다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:1064001025:0":{"text":"라이오스, 마르실, 칠책, 센시는 치피와 해미의 열정적인 설명(또는 자화자찬)을 들으며 내가 겪었던 일과 능력에 대해 알게 되었다","source_cn":"莱欧斯、玛露西尔、齐尔查克和森西也在满满和漫漫的热情说...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:45:1064001026:0":{"text":"그리고 나 역시, 마르실 일행이 다른 세계에서 온 모험가라는 것을 알게 되었다. 이들은 레드 드래곤에게 잡아먹힌 동료 파린을 구하기 위해 미궁을 모험하는 중이었다","source_cn":"你也得知了他们是来自于另一个世界的冒险者。他们在迷宫中...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:46:1064001027:1":{"text":"하지만 파린을 “살려내는 데” 성공했지만, 미궁의 주인을 만나면서 다시 파린과 헤어지게 되었다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:47:1064001028:1":{"text":"이후 변화하는 미궁에서 방향을 잃어, 처음 보는 마물과 마주치게 되었고","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:48:1064001029:1":{"text":"마물과의 전투 이후 모두 의식을 잃은 뒤, 깨어나보니 에스페리아에 도착한 것이었다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064001030:1":{"text":"험난한 모험이었네요! 치피는 듣기만 해도 힘들어요...","source_cn":"好曲折的冒险！满满听着都觉得辛苦……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8417DFDDC0F9EEB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064001031:0":{"text":"조금 힘들긴 했지만, 그래도 다양한 마물의 맛을 볼 수 있었어.","source_cn":"是有点辛苦了，但也品尝到了很多不同风味的魔物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5D2C61DDA5AC4B32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064001032:1":{"text":"...마물을 먹어요?! 으악, 설마 치피를 먹진 않겠죠?!","source_cn":"……吃魔物？！呜哇，你们不会、不会吃满满吧？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FB8FB1D3861FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064001033:0":{"text":"꼬르륵...","source_cn":"咕——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x50227C51D4BBA586","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064001034:0":{"text":"라이오스! 또 겁주는 거야? 그리고 그 꼬르륵 소리 좀 참아봐!","source_cn":"莱欧斯！不要吓人啦！还有，你的肚子叫得太大声了——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD54356F65584482B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064001035:1":{"text":"걱정 마, 치피. 우리라고 모든 마물을 먹는 건 아니야. 종류를 구분해서 먹거든.","source_cn":"别担心，满满！我们可不是什么魔物都吃的，我们会挑选对象的。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9D56E917C8DD67A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064001036:1":{"text":"...그 말, 불난 집에 부채질하는 거 아니야?","source_cn":"……那算是圆场吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB02411C27F8E8BB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064001037:0":{"text":"콜록... 젊은이들을... 굶겨선 안 되지...","source_cn":"咳咳，不能……让年轻人饿肚子……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4893B25613E6ED0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064001038:1":{"text":"...자자! 네 분, 모두 편하게 쉬세요. 멀린 님께서 식사를 준비하라고 하셨거든요.","source_cn":"久等了！根据梅林大人的吩咐我准备了食物，请好好享用并休息吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB5AB3A98374C857F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:65::2":{"text":"월계수 주점 메뉴","source_cn":"月桂酒馆套餐","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCAD1C9B43A1A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064001039:1":{"text":"저희 월계수 주점의 대표 메뉴를 드셔보세요. 파채 소스를 곁들인 특제 닭날개 튀김에, 반딧불이 열매 맥주도 있어요.","source_cn":"请品尝我们月桂酒馆的招牌套餐吧！秘制炸鸡翅配特色葱萝酱...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1064001040:0":{"text":"닭날개?! 완전 정상적인 음식이잖아. 흐윽...","source_cn":"鸡翅？！好正常的食材，呜呜——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCFE0FA73A293D236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064001041:1":{"text":"감동이야! 드디어 마물이 아닌 걸 먹을 수 있다니!","source_cn":"太好了！终于能吃到魔物以外的食物了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC80B2DA8BAB8FA7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064001042:1":{"text":"음, 술 냄새 좋다.","source_cn":"唔，这个啤酒闻起来好香——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1EBB48E8CD35B18F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064001043:1":{"text":"어디 한 입...","source_cn":"我来尝一尝——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x808E7D41BBD78A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064001044:1":{"text":"푸하! 쫀쫀한 거품에 부드러운 목 넘김! 완벽해!","source_cn":"嗝——上层泡沫细腻，酒体醇厚顺滑！果味和麦芽醇香完美平衡！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95A23084BFDF2989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064001045:1":{"text":"호오, 내 입맛에도 괜찮군. 멀미도 많이 괜찮아졌어.","source_cn":"呼！老夫也觉得不错，似乎觉得连眩晕感都好了不少。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38A1AAD0CA0E99C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064001046:1":{"text":"맛있다! 겉은 바삭하고 속은 촉촉해... 바실리스크랑 비슷한 식감인걸?","source_cn":"美味！外皮酥脆，内里多汁……和蛇尾鸡的口感有一些相似呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x778E24B8E095FF3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064001047:1":{"text":"거꾸로잖아! 이게 진짜 닭고기라고!","source_cn":"本末倒置了！这才是纯正的鸡肉啊！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDABBD93D90ACBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064001048:1":{"text":"...바실리스크 얘기가 나와서 말인데, 미궁으로는 어떻게 돌아가지?","source_cn":"……说到蛇尾鸡，我们要怎么回迷宫啊？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9FEB26E5054106B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064001049:0":{"text":"나도 몰라.","source_cn":"我也不知道。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7E12E4FA1E8840D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064001050:0":{"text":"우리가 어떻게 여기로 왔는지도 아직 모르잖아...","source_cn":"我们怎么过来的都没有搞清楚……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6AAFA5C6468DB455","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064001051:0":{"text":"우리, 기절하기 전에 어떤 마물이랑 싸웠지?","source_cn":"我们晕过去之前是跟一个魔物战斗吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A46C9C1585E356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:87:1064001051":{"text":"우리, 기절하기 전에 어떤 마물이랑 싸웠지?","source_cn":"我们晕过去之前是跟一个魔物战斗吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A46C9C1585E356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064001052:1":{"text":"들어본 적도 없고, 본 적도 없는 녀석이었어.","source_cn":"我们没有一个人见过或者听说过。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEE69B41AFDB382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:89:1064001052":{"text":"들어본 적도 없고, 본 적도 없는 녀석이었어.","source_cn":"我们没有一个人见过或者听说过。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEE69B41AFDB382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064001053:1":{"text":"음... 여덟 개의 다리가 주머니 모양의 코어를 감싸고 있는 문어처럼 생긴 마물이었어.","source_cn":"唔……那个魔物有着类似章鱼的构造，有八个腕足保护着囊状核心。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xBF99E6677A703722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064001054:1":{"text":"머리에는 눈이 여러 개 있고, 색깔은 짙은 보랏빛에, 별빛 같은 반점이 있었어.","source_cn":"头上有着好几只深紫色的眼睛，并且带着星光状的斑点。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xE61DB7BC0AE59B2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064001055:1":{"text":"그 짧은 시간 안에 그렇게 많이 관찰한 거야? 대단한데...","source_cn":"亏你能在短时间内观察这么细……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE57DE4928E623653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064001056:1":{"text":"마스터... 마스터가 갖고 계신 마법책에서 저렇게 생긴 걸 본 적이 있어요.","source_cn":"梅林……我好像在你珍藏的魔法书里有见到过这样的魔物。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3A4FE6854BAA7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1064001057:1":{"text":"어라, 정말? 멀린. 그 책은 지금 어디 있어?","source_cn":"咦？真的吗？梅林<male>先生</male><fem...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:98:1064001057":{"text":"어라, 정말? 멀린. 그 책은 지금 어디 있어?","source_cn":"咦？真的吗？梅林<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，请问那本书在哪里？","status":"matched_luae_markup","hash_xxh64":"0xCF79555AABB8B8CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064001058:1":{"text":"그럼 어떡하지? 어서 방법을 찾아야 해. 파린이...","source_cn":"那怎么办？我们得想办法回去，毕竟法琳现在……","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x7EECBF85C5DCE3AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:100:1064001059:1":{"text":"마르실, 진정해요! 그 책은 분명 미스테리 하우스에 있을 테니까, 저랑 마스터가 같이 찾아볼게요!","source_cn":"玛露西尔，先别着急。那本书应该就在神秘屋里，我和主人去...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1064001060:1":{"text":"난 고대마술 연구자니까 같이 갈게. 도움이 될지도 몰라!","source_cn":"我也来帮忙！我研究的是古代魔法，或许能派上用场！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5F222DDAAA607166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:102:1064001061:1":{"text":"그럼 같이 가요!","source_cn":"那就一起吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC34241D6F6F70CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:98:0:1":{"text":"내가 기억을 잃어서...","source_cn":"我失忆了……","status"